<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>JJServer 인증번호</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: 'Pretendard', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f3f4f6; margin: 0; padding: 40px 20px; color: #1f2937;">
    <div style="max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
        
        <!-- Header -->
        <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5 0%, #3b82f6 100%); background-color: #4f46e5; padding: 30px 20px; text-align: center;">
            <h1 style="color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px;">유니헬퍼</h1>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Content -->
        <div style="padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center;">
            <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4b5563; margin: 0 0 20px 0;">요청하신 로그인 인증번호를 안내해 드립니다.</p>
            
            <div style="display: inline-block; background-color: #f8fafc; border: 2px dashed #93c5fd; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px 40px; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 8px; color: #1e3a8a; margin: 10px 0 30px 0;">{{authNumber}}</div>
            
            <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #9ca3af; margin: 0;">해당 인증번호는 <strong style="color: #4b5563;">1분</strong> 동안만 유효합니다.<br/>본인이 요청하지 않은 경우 이 메일을 무시해 주세요.</p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Footer -->
        <div style="background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280;">
            &copy; Unipost Helper System. All rights reserved.
        </div>
        
    </div>
</body>
</html>
